   "len": 36,
   "text": "Then you slept five hours."
  },
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "scene": "night",
   "start": 113,
   "len": 63,
   "text": "One study kept people awake for a single night."
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "scene": "night",
   "start": 179,
   "len": 93,
   "text": "The next day, muscle protein synthesis dropped eighteen percent."
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "scene": "night",
   "start": 275,
   "len": 116,
   "text": "Cortisol went up twenty one percent. Testosterone, down twenty four."
  },
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "scene": "cut",
   "start": 413,
   "len": 127,
   "text": "On a diet? Another study put dieters on five and a half hours of sleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "scene": "cut",
   "start": 543,
   "len": 151,
   "text": "Their share of fat lost fell fifty five percent, and they lost sixty percent more muscle."
  },
  {
